  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC047 warns when ExecuteDelete skips a proven SaveChanges soft-delete conversion or client cascade, including generic contexts, derived interceptors, and HasOne.WithOne with HasForeignKey. LC012 no longer rewrites RemoveRange to ExecuteDelete on those models, including DbSet parameters. A single-property IsDeleted conversion can be rewritten to ExecuteUpdate, including unreduced ExecuteDelete(query) calls.",
